<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns one credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns one credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned one of the four credit auctions whereby it sought to inject 7.185 billion pesos in the secondary market on Wednesday,</p>
<p>dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned or offered as follows:</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>2.092  bln pesos  7 days   30.02  29.70   29.77    4	4</p>
<p>2.093  bln pesos  6 days</p>
<p>1.500  bln pesos  5 days</p>
<p>1.500  bln pesos  2 days</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City Newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
